>
<main class="section" style="max-width:48rem;margin:4rem auto;padding:0 1.5rem;">
<h1 style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Contact Us</h1>

<p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Have a question about Hanfu? Found an error? Want to collaborate? We would love to hear from you.</p>

<h2 style="margin-top:2rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What We Can Help With</h2>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--color-muted);">
<li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Questions about Hanfu styles, history, or how to wear it</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Suggestions for topics you would like us to cover</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Corrections or updates to our content</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Partnership and collaboration inquiries</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Press and media requests</li>
</ul>

<h2 style="margin-top:2rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Email</h2>
<p>Reach us at: <a href="mailto:hello@dresses-hanfu.com" style="color:var(--color-accent);">hello@dresses-hanfu.com</a></p>

<h2 style="margin-top:2rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Social Media</h2>
<p>Follow us on <a href="https://pinterest.com/hanfudressguide" style="color:var(--color-accent);">Pinterest</a> and <a href="https://instagram.com/hanfudressguide" style="color:var(--color-accent);">Instagram</a> for daily Hanfu inspiration.</p>

<p style="margin-top:3rem;color:var(--color-muted);font-size:0.875rem;">We typically respond within 2-3 business days.</p>
</main>
